{"1515370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smuggler Simulator", "steam_appid": 1515370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.poster.avif?t=1771422512\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.webm?t=1771422512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.mp4?t=1771422512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Life at the border crossing is like a lottery - I never know what the next day will bring. People want to move all kinds of goods, and I help them. I love this job.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.poster.avif?t=1771422512\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.webm?t=1771422512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.mp4?t=1771422512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>I fail sometimes, but I know how much people are willing to pay for shifting goods. The rangers are becoming more and more vigilant, so my ideas need to be more and more ... creative.<br><br>But this adrenaline rush during the implementation of my plan ... This joy when I manage to outsmart the border guards ... You have to find out for yourself!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im